绘制旋转后的复数\nax.quiver(0, 0, z_rotated.real, z_rotated.imag, angles='xy', scale_units='xy', scale=1, color='r',            
label=f'旋转 {math.degrees(theta):.0f}°')\n\nax.legend()\nplt.show()\n</code>"                                                  
